# Project Rules & Safeguards
- Causal Models: Use pgmpy and explicit Structural Causal Models (SCMs).
- Inference Verification: Ensure exact agreement between Variable Elimination and Clique Tree inference within 1e-6 numerical tolerance.
- Data Leakage: Fit all preprocessing, binning, and calibrations solely on the training set.
- Fairness: Focus on counterfactual sensitivity across 3-5 candidate graphs; report Delta EOdds, Delta DP, and bootstrap CIs.
